Package: kcloud.r
Type: Package
Title: One API for Local, 'Nextcloud', 'S3' and 'rclone' Data Storages
Version: 0.0.0.9000
Authors@R: c(
    person(
      given = c("Kevin", "Bosirany"),
      family = "Orlando",
      email = "kevinbosirany@gmail.com",
      role = c("aut", "cre"),
      comment = c(ORCID = "0009-0009-2784-3108")
    )
  )
Description: Read and write data files with the same functions wherever
    they are stored: on a local disk or on 'Nextcloud' (public link or
    account, through 'WebDAV'), and soon in 'S3' buckets and 'rclone'
    remotes. Remote files are downloaded into a persistent cache whose
    freshness is checked with the 'ETag' of the files and whose size is
    bounded. Storages are described in a 'config.yml' file, with the
    secrets read from environment variables.
